       macro avg       0.62      0.51      0.47      2874
    weighted avg       0.77      0.84      0.77      2874
    
    

**Show the Confusion Matrix for the predictions.**


```python
conf_matrix = confusion_matrix(y_test, predictions)
print("Confusion Matrix:")
print(conf_matrix)
```

